							<p>Located on the west side of campus in the lower levels of Burton and Severance Hall. Burton Dining Hall is an all-you-can-eat dining experience with a wide variety of options from home-style comfort food to an extensive salad/sandwich bar and of course plenty dessert options to satisfy your sweet tooth.</p>
